[
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.540",
    "end": "00:00:06.580",
    "start_seconds": 3.54,
    "end_seconds": 6.58,
    "text": "Whitney Pennington Rodgers: You run the Dubai Future Foundation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.580",
    "end": "00:00:10.460",
    "start_seconds": 6.58,
    "end_seconds": 10.46,
    "text": "For those of us who are not initiated, what is a future foundation?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.500",
    "end": "00:00:13.940",
    "start_seconds": 10.5,
    "end_seconds": 13.94,
    "text": "His Excellency Khalfan Belhoul: So imagine you run a lab,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.980",
    "end": "00:00:17.940",
    "start_seconds": 13.98,
    "end_seconds": 17.94,
    "text": "and the owner of the lab comes to you and says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.980",
    "end": "00:00:21.380",
    "start_seconds": 17.98,
    "end_seconds": 21.38,
    "text": "\"You can do whatever you want,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:21.420",
    "end": "00:00:23.460",
    "start_seconds": 21.42,
    "end_seconds": 23.46,
    "text": "and you have my full backing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.460",
    "end": "00:00:29.100",
    "start_seconds": 23.46,
    "end_seconds": 29.1,
    "text": "and you have a solid amount of financial resources."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.140",
    "end": "00:00:33.700",
    "start_seconds": 29.14,
    "end_seconds": 33.7,
    "text": "If rules are an issue, we can change them for you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.460",
    "end": "00:00:39.900",
    "start_seconds": 34.46,
    "end_seconds": 39.9,
    "text": "We can connect you with any relevant decision maker to break those rules."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.940",
    "end": "00:00:44.580",
    "start_seconds": 40.94,
    "end_seconds": 44.58,
    "text": "We will not be upset if you make mistakes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.620",
    "end": "00:00:48.020",
    "start_seconds": 44.62,
    "end_seconds": 48.02,
    "text": "and we will support you on every winning bet you make.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.100",
    "end": "00:00:50.820",
    "start_seconds": 49.1,
    "end_seconds": 50.82,
    "text": "And in summary, will you take that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.820",
    "end": "00:00:52.220",
    "start_seconds": 50.82,
    "end_seconds": 52.22,
    "text": "WPR: I would take that deal."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.220",
    "end": "00:00:56.500",
    "start_seconds": 52.22,
    "end_seconds": 56.5,
    "text": "HEKB: OK, so the owner of the lab is Sheikh Mohammad bin Rashid,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:56.500",
    "end": "00:00:59.060",
    "start_seconds": 56.5,
    "end_seconds": 59.06,
    "text": "and the lab is Dubai Future Foundation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.100",
    "end": "00:01:00.260",
    "start_seconds": 59.1,
    "end_seconds": 60.26,
    "text": "So that’s how it is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.300",
    "end": "00:01:04.340",
    "start_seconds": 60.3,
    "end_seconds": 64.34,
    "text": "We are entitled and empowered to explore new ideas --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.340",
    "end": "00:01:06.660",
    "start_seconds": 64.34,
    "end_seconds": 66.66,
    "text": "to see where the future is heading."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.100",
    "end": "00:01:11.500",
    "start_seconds": 67.1,
    "end_seconds": 71.5,
    "text": "We’ve been supported and backed by a top board of trustees --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.540",
    "end": "00:01:13.900",
    "start_seconds": 71.53999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 73.9,
    "text": "I mean, our chairman is the crown prince."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:13.900",
    "end": "00:01:19.780",
    "start_seconds": 73.9,
    "end_seconds": 79.78,
    "text": "The board members are ministers and director generals across all sectors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.780",
    "end": "00:01:22.180",
    "start_seconds": 79.78,
    "end_seconds": 82.18,
    "text": "Which means if we want to disrupt mobility, we can."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.220",
    "end": "00:01:24.580",
    "start_seconds": 82.22,
    "end_seconds": 84.58,
    "text": "If we want to talk health tech, we can."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.580",
    "end": "00:01:27.420",
    "start_seconds": 84.58,
    "end_seconds": 87.42,
    "text": "If we want to explore fintech, we can."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.460",
    "end": "00:01:31.660",
    "start_seconds": 87.46000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 91.66,
    "text": "We have the muscle behind us, and we have the support in case we fail."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.700",
    "end": "00:01:34.820",
    "start_seconds": 91.7,
    "end_seconds": 94.82,
    "text": "The unique thing [that] makes us --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.860",
    "end": "00:01:36.900",
    "start_seconds": 94.86,
    "end_seconds": 96.9,
    "text": "which I’m sure you’re aware of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.940",
    "end": "00:01:39.660",
    "start_seconds": 96.94,
    "end_seconds": 99.66,
    "text": "from the global landscape --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.700",
    "end": "00:01:42.780",
    "start_seconds": 99.7,
    "end_seconds": 102.78,
    "text": "that usually governments are a hurdle or they take time"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.820",
    "end": "00:01:44.180",
    "start_seconds": 102.82,
    "end_seconds": 104.18,
    "text": "or they're bureaucratic."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.180",
    "end": "00:01:47.060",
    "start_seconds": 104.18,
    "end_seconds": 107.06,
    "text": "We are hearing from our leaders that we can actually do this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.100",
    "end": "00:01:48.340",
    "start_seconds": 107.1,
    "end_seconds": 108.34,
    "text": "This is music to our ears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.380",
    "end": "00:01:49.540",
    "start_seconds": 108.38,
    "end_seconds": 109.53999999999999,
    "text": "So this pushes us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.580",
    "end": "00:01:53.140",
    "start_seconds": 109.58,
    "end_seconds": 113.14,
    "text": "This makes us comfortable at actually pivoting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.180",
    "end": "00:01:55.580",
    "start_seconds": 113.18,
    "end_seconds": 115.58,
    "text": "And if we have any venture capitalists out here --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.620",
    "end": "00:01:57.820",
    "start_seconds": 115.62,
    "end_seconds": 117.82,
    "text": "you would understand this more than anyone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.980",
    "end": "00:02:01.420",
    "start_seconds": 117.97999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 121.42,
    "text": "They don’t talk about [the] 80 percent of their portfolio that goes bust,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:01.420",
    "end": "00:02:03.740",
    "start_seconds": 121.42,
    "end_seconds": 123.74,
    "text": "but they really back the winning bets."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.780",
    "end": "00:02:07.420",
    "start_seconds": 123.78,
    "end_seconds": 127.42,
    "text": "They’ve all made those mistakes, but they don’t look at them as mistakes --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:07.460",
    "end": "00:02:09.260",
    "start_seconds": 127.46,
    "end_seconds": 129.26,
    "text": "they look at them as learning points."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.260",
    "end": "00:02:12.220",
    "start_seconds": 129.26,
    "end_seconds": 132.22,
    "text": "And I think this mindset that’s been given to us from leaders,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.220",
    "end": "00:02:15.980",
    "start_seconds": 132.22,
    "end_seconds": 135.98,
    "text": "to really explore and test and double down on winning bets,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.980",
    "end": "00:02:18.620",
    "start_seconds": 135.98,
    "end_seconds": 138.62,
    "text": "is what makes the Dubai Future Foundation a success."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.660",
    "end": "00:02:22.380",
    "start_seconds": 138.66,
    "end_seconds": 142.38,
    "text": "WPR: I think a lot of nations and a lot of cities talk about this idea"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.420",
    "end": "00:02:25.700",
    "start_seconds": 142.42000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 145.7,
    "text": "of progress and being futurist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.700",
    "end": "00:02:27.580",
    "start_seconds": 145.7,
    "end_seconds": 147.57999999999998,
    "text": "but it's hard to sustain that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.620",
    "end": "00:02:31.620",
    "start_seconds": 147.62,
    "end_seconds": 151.62,
    "text": "What are some of the ways that you’re able to get buy-in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.660",
    "end": "00:02:36.300",
    "start_seconds": 151.66,
    "end_seconds": 156.3,
    "text": "and to be able to embed in both government and culture, futurist thinking?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.340",
    "end": "00:02:39.100",
    "start_seconds": 156.34,
    "end_seconds": 159.1,
    "text": "HEKB: What we do is we start, first of all,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.140",
    "end": "00:02:42.900",
    "start_seconds": 159.14,
    "end_seconds": 162.9,
    "text": "by ensuring that our internal teams are experts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.940",
    "end": "00:02:45.820",
    "start_seconds": 162.94,
    "end_seconds": 165.82,
    "text": "in understanding where the future is heading."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.860",
    "end": "00:02:49.060",
    "start_seconds": 165.86,
    "end_seconds": 169.06,
    "text": "We invest a lot in people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.100",
    "end": "00:02:52.860",
    "start_seconds": 169.1,
    "end_seconds": 172.86,
    "text": "that have this ... expertise"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.900",
    "end": "00:02:54.540",
    "start_seconds": 172.9,
    "end_seconds": 174.54,
    "text": "when it comes to future foresight."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.540",
    "end": "00:02:58.020",
    "start_seconds": 174.54,
    "end_seconds": 178.02,
    "text": "We invest a lot in internal talent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.020",
    "end": "00:03:03.100",
    "start_seconds": 178.02,
    "end_seconds": 183.1,
    "text": "We have a foresight team that does horizon scanning on a constant basis,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.100",
    "end": "00:03:04.620",
    "start_seconds": 183.1,
    "end_seconds": 184.62,
    "text": "and this becomes our engine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.660",
    "end": "00:03:08.060",
    "start_seconds": 184.66,
    "end_seconds": 188.06,
    "text": "But we don't stop there because this is not only confined to us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.060",
    "end": "00:03:09.380",
    "start_seconds": 188.06,
    "end_seconds": 189.38,
    "text": "as Dubai Future Foundation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.420",
    "end": "00:03:12.660",
    "start_seconds": 189.42,
    "end_seconds": 192.66,
    "text": "We also connect with like-minded networks from all over the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.700",
    "end": "00:03:14.660",
    "start_seconds": 192.7,
    "end_seconds": 194.66,
    "text": "that feed us more information."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.460",
    "end": "00:03:19.940",
    "start_seconds": 195.46,
    "end_seconds": 199.94,
    "text": "And then this gives us a view of where the future is heading."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.980",
    "end": "00:03:22.220",
    "start_seconds": 199.98,
    "end_seconds": 202.22,
    "text": "And the further you go -- the grayer it becomes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.220",
    "end": "00:03:25.700",
    "start_seconds": 202.22,
    "end_seconds": 205.7,
    "text": "We can maybe have a better prediction of what’s happening in 2026,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.140",
    "end": "00:03:27.420",
    "start_seconds": 206.14,
    "end_seconds": 207.42000000000002,
    "text": "but the more you go,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.460",
    "end": "00:03:30.740",
    "start_seconds": 207.46,
    "end_seconds": 210.74,
    "text": "the more challenging the guess would be, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.780",
    "end": "00:03:32.540",
    "start_seconds": 210.78,
    "end_seconds": 212.54,
    "text": "But the more conversations you have,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.580",
    "end": "00:03:35.140",
    "start_seconds": 212.57999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 215.14,
    "text": "the more inclusion there is in the conversation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.180",
    "end": "00:03:36.940",
    "start_seconds": 215.18,
    "end_seconds": 216.94,
    "text": "the better visibility you have."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.980",
    "end": "00:03:41.260",
    "start_seconds": 216.98,
    "end_seconds": 221.26,
    "text": "Then it’s all about being agile and flexible and getting everyone involved"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.260",
    "end": "00:03:43.220",
    "start_seconds": 221.26,
    "end_seconds": 223.22,
    "text": "and having the guts to really test."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.940",
    "end": "00:03:46.940",
    "start_seconds": 223.94,
    "end_seconds": 226.94,
    "text": "Test, but at the same time create a safe environment in testing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.980",
    "end": "00:03:49.940",
    "start_seconds": 226.98,
    "end_seconds": 229.94,
    "text": "So you get the entrepreneurs, you get the investors,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.980",
    "end": "00:03:53.060",
    "start_seconds": 229.98,
    "end_seconds": 233.06,
    "text": "and you back it up by also investing as government"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.060",
    "end": "00:03:54.420",
    "start_seconds": 233.06,
    "end_seconds": 234.42000000000002,
    "text": "and create an environment --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.420",
    "end": "00:03:56.700",
    "start_seconds": 234.42000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 236.7,
    "text": "which is what we call the sandbox environment --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.700",
    "end": "00:04:00.300",
    "start_seconds": 236.7,
    "end_seconds": 240.3,
    "text": "which is really testing those ideas in a safe manner."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.300",
    "end": "00:04:03.500",
    "start_seconds": 240.3,
    "end_seconds": 243.5,
    "text": "For example, if you're looking at last-mile drone deliveries,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.500",
    "end": "00:04:05.020",
    "start_seconds": 243.5,
    "end_seconds": 245.02,
    "text": "you're not going to deploy that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.020",
    "end": "00:04:07.420",
    "start_seconds": 245.02,
    "end_seconds": 247.42,
    "text": "before you actually make sure it's safe for people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.460",
    "end": "00:04:09.420",
    "start_seconds": 247.46,
    "end_seconds": 249.42,
    "text": "You need that physical space for that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.420",
    "end": "00:04:12.580",
    "start_seconds": 249.42,
    "end_seconds": 252.58,
    "text": "On the less physical and less tangible kind of projects --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.620",
    "end": "00:04:15.660",
    "start_seconds": 252.62,
    "end_seconds": 255.66,
    "text": "look at the crypto world and the digital assets --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.700",
    "end": "00:04:18.940",
    "start_seconds": 255.7,
    "end_seconds": 258.94,
    "text": "you don’t see them in front of you, but the value of them is immense."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.980",
    "end": "00:04:21.140",
    "start_seconds": 258.98,
    "end_seconds": 261.14,
    "text": "But can we actually open them up to the market"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.140",
    "end": "00:04:23.780",
    "start_seconds": 261.14,
    "end_seconds": 263.78,
    "text": "before we create a virtual safe environment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.820",
    "end": "00:04:26.180",
    "start_seconds": 263.82,
    "end_seconds": 266.18,
    "text": "including all the relevant parties,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.180",
    "end": "00:04:30.900",
    "start_seconds": 266.18,
    "end_seconds": 270.9,
    "text": "to have a proper conversation on a deployment basis?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.940",
    "end": "00:04:33.740",
    "start_seconds": 270.94,
    "end_seconds": 273.74,
    "text": "I mean, we can do as much of that as we want,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.780",
    "end": "00:04:36.420",
    "start_seconds": 273.78,
    "end_seconds": 276.42,
    "text": "but if there isn’t a mechanism"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.420",
    "end": "00:04:39.420",
    "start_seconds": 276.42,
    "end_seconds": 279.42,
    "text": "of ensuring that this can be deployed safely"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.460",
    "end": "00:04:42.220",
    "start_seconds": 279.46,
    "end_seconds": 282.22,
    "text": "and in a unified way,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.260",
    "end": "00:04:44.500",
    "start_seconds": 282.26,
    "end_seconds": 284.5,
    "text": "then we'll just be talking to ourselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.540",
    "end": "00:04:48.020",
    "start_seconds": 284.54,
    "end_seconds": 288.02,
    "text": "WPR: Well I think Dubai represents such a compelling example"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.060",
    "end": "00:04:50.060",
    "start_seconds": 288.06,
    "end_seconds": 290.06,
    "text": "of economic transformation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.060",
    "end": "00:04:51.820",
    "start_seconds": 290.06,
    "end_seconds": 291.82,
    "text": "shifting away from oil revenue"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.860",
    "end": "00:04:53.780",
    "start_seconds": 291.86,
    "end_seconds": 293.78,
    "text": "to other spaces like tourism."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.180",
    "end": "00:04:58.420",
    "start_seconds": 294.18,
    "end_seconds": 298.42,
    "text": "Can you talk about the current economic state of Dubai"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:58.460",
    "end": "00:05:02.380",
    "start_seconds": 298.46,
    "end_seconds": 302.38,
    "text": "and sort of how you think that will influence where the city is headed?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.420",
    "end": "00:05:06.100",
    "start_seconds": 302.42,
    "end_seconds": 306.1,
    "text": "HEKB: We are living in a very turbulent environment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.460",
    "end": "00:05:08.980",
    "start_seconds": 306.46,
    "end_seconds": 308.98,
    "text": "The Middle East is a very tough neighborhood."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.060",
    "end": "00:05:13.460",
    "start_seconds": 310.06,
    "end_seconds": 313.46,
    "text": "Our country is not so big from a size perspective,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.500",
    "end": "00:05:15.780",
    "start_seconds": 313.5,
    "end_seconds": 315.78,
    "text": "but our ambitions are bigger than anyone’s."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.620",
    "end": "00:05:18.820",
    "start_seconds": 316.62,
    "end_seconds": 318.82,
    "text": "We have tensions around the world,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.860",
    "end": "00:05:24.220",
    "start_seconds": 318.86,
    "end_seconds": 324.22,
    "text": "whether it’s big nations conflicting on economicissues,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:24.260",
    "end": "00:05:25.620",
    "start_seconds": 324.26,
    "end_seconds": 325.62,
    "text": "geopolitical issues,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.660",
    "end": "00:05:30.780",
    "start_seconds": 325.66,
    "end_seconds": 330.78,
    "text": "and the country has pushed itself to be a bridge of peace, or"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.820",
    "end": "00:05:34.500",
    "start_seconds": 330.82,
    "end_seconds": 334.5,
    "text": "when it comes to business, when it comes to geopolitics."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.500",
    "end": "00:05:38.100",
    "start_seconds": 334.5,
    "end_seconds": 338.1,
    "text": "And I think this is what really attracts people to come to Dubai."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.140",
    "end": "00:05:40.220",
    "start_seconds": 338.14,
    "end_seconds": 340.22,
    "text": "We as locals"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.220",
    "end": "00:05:44.020",
    "start_seconds": 340.22,
    "end_seconds": 344.02,
    "text": "tend to underestimate the safety factor"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.020",
    "end": "00:05:45.540",
    "start_seconds": 344.02,
    "end_seconds": 345.54,
    "text": "and the prosperity factor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.580",
    "end": "00:05:48.020",
    "start_seconds": 345.58,
    "end_seconds": 348.02,
    "text": "We just got too comfortable and got too used to it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.060",
    "end": "00:05:51.820",
    "start_seconds": 348.06,
    "end_seconds": 351.82,
    "text": "But when we have conversations with our fellow expats"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.860",
    "end": "00:05:55.500",
    "start_seconds": 351.86,
    "end_seconds": 355.5,
    "text": "that come in and choose Dubai or the UAE as home --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.540",
    "end": "00:05:57.020",
    "start_seconds": 355.54,
    "end_seconds": 357.02,
    "text": "we listen to them,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.060",
    "end": "00:05:58.580",
    "start_seconds": 357.06,
    "end_seconds": 358.58,
    "text": "[and it] gives me goosebumps"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.620",
    "end": "00:06:02.980",
    "start_seconds": 358.62,
    "end_seconds": 362.98,
    "text": "on how those small details"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.020",
    "end": "00:06:06.460",
    "start_seconds": 363.02,
    "end_seconds": 366.46,
    "text": "of safety and prosperity for them and their families"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.460",
    "end": "00:06:11.220",
    "start_seconds": 366.46,
    "end_seconds": 371.22,
    "text": "mean so much that makes us really appreciate the structure here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:11.260",
    "end": "00:06:12.980",
    "start_seconds": 371.26,
    "end_seconds": 372.98,
    "text": "But again, we’re not perfect."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.980",
    "end": "00:06:15.020",
    "start_seconds": 372.98,
    "end_seconds": 375.02,
    "text": "We've done our fair share of mistakes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:15.020",
    "end": "00:06:16.900",
    "start_seconds": 375.02,
    "end_seconds": 376.9,
    "text": "but we double down on what we do right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.940",
    "end": "00:06:22.900",
    "start_seconds": 376.94,
    "end_seconds": 382.9,
    "text": "WPR: We seem to be in a very transformative moment as a world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.900",
    "end": "00:06:25.740",
    "start_seconds": 382.9,
    "end_seconds": 385.74,
    "text": "What role do you think -- when you think about things like,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.740",
    "end": "00:06:28.540",
    "start_seconds": 385.74,
    "end_seconds": 388.54,
    "text": "beyond even just geopolitical tensions as you mentioned,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:28.540",
    "end": "00:06:30.340",
    "start_seconds": 388.54,
    "end_seconds": 390.34,
    "text": "and economic issues,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.380",
    "end": "00:06:32.980",
    "start_seconds": 390.38,
    "end_seconds": 392.98,
    "text": "[or] when you think about existential threats"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:32.980",
    "end": "00:06:35.900",
    "start_seconds": 392.98,
    "end_seconds": 395.9,
    "text": "like climate change or the rise of artificial intelligence --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.940",
    "end": "00:06:39.180",
    "start_seconds": 395.94,
    "end_seconds": 399.18,
    "text": "what role do you see futurists thinking playing in global progress?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.220",
    "end": "00:06:41.140",
    "start_seconds": 399.22,
    "end_seconds": 401.14,
    "text": "HEKB: So I’ll tell you my humble advice:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.180",
    "end": "00:06:44.500",
    "start_seconds": 401.18,
    "end_seconds": 404.5,
    "text": "The world has recently been giving us so many signs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.540",
    "end": "00:06:49.500",
    "start_seconds": 404.54,
    "end_seconds": 409.5,
    "text": "that there’s no other way forward"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.540",
    "end": "00:06:52.140",
    "start_seconds": 409.54,
    "end_seconds": 412.14,
    "text": "than us to all get together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.460",
    "end": "00:06:53.700",
    "start_seconds": 412.46,
    "end_seconds": 413.7,
    "text": "You’ve mentioned them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.540",
    "end": "00:06:56.220",
    "start_seconds": 414.54,
    "end_seconds": 416.22,
    "text": "Geopolitical issues"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.220",
    "end": "00:06:57.780",
    "start_seconds": 416.22,
    "end_seconds": 417.78,
    "text": "are not going to work --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.780",
    "end": "00:07:00.380",
    "start_seconds": 417.78,
    "end_seconds": 420.38,
    "text": "we need to work together for peace."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.980",
    "end": "00:07:04.380",
    "start_seconds": 420.98,
    "end_seconds": 424.38,
    "text": "[The] digital economy, which is in trillions of dollars"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.420",
    "end": "00:07:07.620",
    "start_seconds": 424.42,
    "end_seconds": 427.62,
    "text": "when we talk about the value of AI,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.660",
    "end": "00:07:09.860",
    "start_seconds": 427.66,
    "end_seconds": 429.86,
    "text": "we’re talking, economy-wise,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.860",
    "end": "00:07:11.500",
    "start_seconds": 429.86,
    "end_seconds": 431.5,
    "text": "about trillions --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.540",
    "end": "00:07:12.780",
    "start_seconds": 431.54,
    "end_seconds": 432.78,
    "text": "that’s another sign."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.780",
    "end": "00:07:14.940",
    "start_seconds": 432.78,
    "end_seconds": 434.94,
    "text": "Climate change,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.980",
    "end": "00:07:16.460",
    "start_seconds": 434.98,
    "end_seconds": 436.46,
    "text": "how can we solve for that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.460",
    "end": "00:07:19.540",
    "start_seconds": 436.46,
    "end_seconds": 439.54,
    "text": "There needs to be, we've seen it in COP announcements and beyond,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.580",
    "end": "00:07:22.220",
    "start_seconds": 439.58,
    "end_seconds": 442.22,
    "text": "there needs to be unity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.820",
    "end": "00:07:24.980",
    "start_seconds": 443.82,
    "end_seconds": 444.98,
    "text": "AI."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.020",
    "end": "00:07:26.580",
    "start_seconds": 445.02,
    "end_seconds": 446.58,
    "text": "I mean,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:26.620",
    "end": "00:07:28.620",
    "start_seconds": 446.62,
    "end_seconds": 448.62,
    "text": "if I start to talk about AI, I won't stop."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.660",
    "end": "00:07:29.940",
    "start_seconds": 448.66,
    "end_seconds": 449.94,
    "text": "I mean, how many of us ..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.980",
    "end": "00:07:31.460",
    "start_seconds": 449.98,
    "end_seconds": 451.46,
    "text": "Let me maybe start with you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.460",
    "end": "00:07:36.900",
    "start_seconds": 451.46,
    "end_seconds": 456.9,
    "text": "How much do you use ChatGPT, Grok, or you name it, those LLMs?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.900",
    "end": "00:07:38.060",
    "start_seconds": 456.9,
    "end_seconds": 458.06,
    "text": "Do you use it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.100",
    "end": "00:07:39.260",
    "start_seconds": 458.1,
    "end_seconds": 459.26,
    "text": "WPR: Regularly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.260",
    "end": "00:07:40.700",
    "start_seconds": 459.26,
    "end_seconds": 460.7,
    "text": "HEKB: Do you use it daily?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.740",
    "end": "00:07:41.900",
    "start_seconds": 460.74,
    "end_seconds": 461.9,
    "text": "WPR: Probably, yeah."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.940",
    "end": "00:07:43.100",
    "start_seconds": 461.94,
    "end_seconds": 463.1,
    "text": "HEKB: I use it daily."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.140",
    "end": "00:07:44.260",
    "start_seconds": 463.14,
    "end_seconds": 464.26,
    "text": "Raise of hands."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.300",
    "end": "00:07:45.460",
    "start_seconds": 464.3,
    "end_seconds": 465.46,
    "text": "Do you use it daily?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.500",
    "end": "00:07:46.660",
    "start_seconds": 465.5,
    "end_seconds": 466.65999999999997,
    "text": "OK."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.700",
    "end": "00:07:49.060",
    "start_seconds": 466.7,
    "end_seconds": 469.06,
    "text": "Do you use it to the extent that you actually feel"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:49.060",
    "end": "00:07:51.780",
    "start_seconds": 469.06,
    "end_seconds": 471.78,
    "text": "there's a person sitting on the other side talking to you?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.780",
    "end": "00:07:53.580",
    "start_seconds": 471.78,
    "end_seconds": 473.58,
    "text": "WPR: Not yet, but I know many who do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.580",
    "end": "00:07:55.260",
    "start_seconds": 473.58,
    "end_seconds": 475.26,
    "text": "HEKB: I'm close to that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.300",
    "end": "00:07:58.340",
    "start_seconds": 475.3,
    "end_seconds": 478.34000000000003,
    "text": "I’m telling you -- from the fact that we interact"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.340",
    "end": "00:08:00.460",
    "start_seconds": 478.34000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 480.46,
    "text": "and the emotional angle sometimes you get,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:00.460",
    "end": "00:08:02.220",
    "start_seconds": 480.46,
    "end_seconds": 482.22,
    "text": "and the responses --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.260",
    "end": "00:08:06.220",
    "start_seconds": 482.26,
    "end_seconds": 486.22,
    "text": "we haven’t even scratched the surface on how [to] deal with that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:06.260",
    "end": "00:08:09.580",
    "start_seconds": 486.26,
    "end_seconds": 489.58,
    "text": "And you feel so comfortable talking to ChatGPT and many of those LLMs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.620",
    "end": "00:08:12.020",
    "start_seconds": 489.62,
    "end_seconds": 492.02,
    "text": "so imagine you actually --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:12.020",
    "end": "00:08:13.500",
    "start_seconds": 492.02,
    "end_seconds": 493.5,
    "text": "this gets,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.500",
    "end": "00:08:17.460",
    "start_seconds": 493.5,
    "end_seconds": 497.46,
    "text": "and I’ve said this, maybe I might sound like a broken record to my colleagues --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.500",
    "end": "00:08:22.260",
    "start_seconds": 497.5,
    "end_seconds": 502.26,
    "text": "but imagine having this conversation with a robot that looks like a human --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:22.300",
    "end": "00:08:24.860",
    "start_seconds": 502.3,
    "end_seconds": 504.86,
    "text": "which we are not far from seeing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.900",
    "end": "00:08:27.580",
    "start_seconds": 504.9,
    "end_seconds": 507.58,
    "text": "and I promise you that this is going to come very soon --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.620",
    "end": "00:08:30.180",
    "start_seconds": 507.62,
    "end_seconds": 510.18,
    "text": "with the same intellect of the ChatGPT,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.220",
    "end": "00:08:32.820",
    "start_seconds": 510.22,
    "end_seconds": 512.82,
    "text": "[or] even a thousand times much more than that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:33.300",
    "end": "00:08:37.260",
    "start_seconds": 513.3,
    "end_seconds": 517.26,
    "text": "What happens to humanity and how do we really interact,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:37.260",
    "end": "00:08:39.380",
    "start_seconds": 517.26,
    "end_seconds": 519.38,
    "text": "even from an emotional standpoint?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.740",
    "end": "00:08:42.620",
    "start_seconds": 519.74,
    "end_seconds": 522.62,
    "text": "We have some weak and vulnerable individuals around the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:42.620",
    "end": "00:08:45.260",
    "start_seconds": 522.62,
    "end_seconds": 525.26,
    "text": "that feel more comfortable with robots than humans."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:45.820",
    "end": "00:08:48.540",
    "start_seconds": 525.82,
    "end_seconds": 528.54,
    "text": "So what would this mean to us as humanity?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:48.540",
    "end": "00:08:50.900",
    "start_seconds": 528.54,
    "end_seconds": 530.9,
    "text": "Are we going to get attached to robots?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.940",
    "end": "00:08:52.580",
    "start_seconds": 530.94,
    "end_seconds": 532.58,
    "text": "How are we going to regulate that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.580",
    "end": "00:08:56.420",
    "start_seconds": 532.58,
    "end_seconds": 536.42,
    "text": "How are we going to really extract value [from] artificial intelligence?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:56.460",
    "end": "00:09:00.780",
    "start_seconds": 536.46,
    "end_seconds": 540.78,
    "text": "That’s why I’m saying [that] what we see with ChatGPT now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:00.820",
    "end": "00:09:03.380",
    "start_seconds": 540.82,
    "end_seconds": 543.38,
    "text": "is the first second of the first minute"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:03.420",
    "end": "00:09:06.100",
    "start_seconds": 543.42,
    "end_seconds": 546.1,
    "text": "of the first hour of the first day"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:06.140",
    "end": "00:09:11.220",
    "start_seconds": 546.14,
    "end_seconds": 551.22,
    "text": "of the first year of this beast that has so much value,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:11.260",
    "end": "00:09:14.940",
    "start_seconds": 551.26,
    "end_seconds": 554.94,
    "text": "but that we really need to embrace [it], and we need to embrace [it] jointly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:15.540",
    "end": "00:09:18.260",
    "start_seconds": 555.54,
    "end_seconds": 558.26,
    "text": "And there's no chance that Dubai or the UAE"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:18.260",
    "end": "00:09:20.020",
    "start_seconds": 558.26,
    "end_seconds": 560.02,
    "text": "or the Middle East can do it alone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:20.020",
    "end": "00:09:21.860",
    "start_seconds": 560.02,
    "end_seconds": 561.86,
    "text": "Nor the US, nor China --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:21.900",
    "end": "00:09:24.660",
    "start_seconds": 561.9,
    "end_seconds": 564.66,
    "text": "it’s a collaborative effort."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:24.660",
    "end": "00:09:26.940",
    "start_seconds": 564.66,
    "end_seconds": 566.94,
    "text": "Even look at our kids now [and]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.980",
    "end": "00:09:29.220",
    "start_seconds": 566.98,
    "end_seconds": 569.22,
    "text": "their attachment to technology --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:29.220",
    "end": "00:09:30.500",
    "start_seconds": 569.22,
    "end_seconds": 570.5,
    "text": "what is the right balance?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:30.500",
    "end": "00:09:33.220",
    "start_seconds": 570.5,
    "end_seconds": 573.22,
    "text": "They’re so smart in front of screens,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.540",
    "end": "00:09:36.420",
    "start_seconds": 573.54,
    "end_seconds": 576.42,
    "text": "but if you ask them to come on stage and have a conversation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:36.420",
    "end": "00:09:37.980",
    "start_seconds": 576.42,
    "end_seconds": 577.98,
    "text": "they might not be as comfortable"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.980",
    "end": "00:09:40.380",
    "start_seconds": 577.98,
    "end_seconds": 580.38,
    "text": "because they’re just so involved with technology,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:40.380",
    "end": "00:09:43.140",
    "start_seconds": 580.38,
    "end_seconds": 583.14,
    "text": "and they do things that I’ll probably never think of doing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:43.180",
    "end": "00:09:46.860",
    "start_seconds": 583.18,
    "end_seconds": 586.86,
    "text": "because they’re so into it, and they’re doing such an amazing job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:46.860",
    "end": "00:09:50.020",
    "start_seconds": 586.86,
    "end_seconds": 590.02,
    "text": "But life is not only about that -- it’s how you strike the balance."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.020",
    "end": "00:09:52.460",
    "start_seconds": 590.02,
    "end_seconds": 592.46,
    "text": "And how do we really huddle up together as humanity?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:52.460",
    "end": "00:09:56.580",
    "start_seconds": 592.46,
    "end_seconds": 596.58,
    "text": "Because technology is super valuable, but humans are more important."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:57.300",
    "end": "00:09:58.660",
    "start_seconds": 597.3,
    "end_seconds": 598.66,
    "text": "WPR: Well, Your Excellency,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:58.660",
    "end": "00:10:01.380",
    "start_seconds": 598.66,
    "end_seconds": 601.38,
    "text": "I cannot let you go without asking you this last question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:01.420",
    "end": "00:10:03.740",
    "start_seconds": 601.42,
    "end_seconds": 603.74,
    "text": "You spend so much time thinking about the future."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.740",
    "end": "00:10:06.660",
    "start_seconds": 603.74,
    "end_seconds": 606.66,
    "text": "What do you think is the big thing that many of us are missing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:06.700",
    "end": "00:10:08.340",
    "start_seconds": 606.7,
    "end_seconds": 608.34,
    "text": "when we think about what's ahead?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:08.380",
    "end": "00:10:10.300",
    "start_seconds": 608.38,
    "end_seconds": 610.3,
    "text": "HEKB: There's one that sticks out to me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:10.340",
    "end": "00:10:12.980",
    "start_seconds": 610.34,
    "end_seconds": 612.98,
    "text": "So I'll mention a few and then I'll tell you which one."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:13.020",
    "end": "00:10:16.580",
    "start_seconds": 613.02,
    "end_seconds": 616.58,
    "text": "So I mean, longevity and living to --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:16.580",
    "end": "00:10:18.420",
    "start_seconds": 616.58,
    "end_seconds": 618.42,
    "text": "especially with the ..."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:18.420",
    "end": "00:10:20.860",
    "start_seconds": 618.42,
    "end_seconds": 620.86,
    "text": "advancement of neuroscience at the moment --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:20.860",
    "end": "00:10:23.220",
    "start_seconds": 620.86,
    "end_seconds": 623.22,
    "text": "we can see people living until 150 years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:23.260",
    "end": "00:10:24.660",
    "start_seconds": 623.26,
    "end_seconds": 624.66,
    "text": "and this is not far from now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:24.660",
    "end": "00:10:28.900",
    "start_seconds": 624.66,
    "end_seconds": 628.9,
    "text": "I think [this is] a statement that is exciting to many."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:28.900",
    "end": "00:10:32.340",
    "start_seconds": 628.9,
    "end_seconds": 632.34,
    "text": "I’m not sure if you guys are excited about this, but [for] many people --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:32.340",
    "end": "00:10:33.740",
    "start_seconds": 632.34,
    "end_seconds": 633.74,
    "text": "if you’re in good health --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:33.740",
    "end": "00:10:35.700",
    "start_seconds": 633.74,
    "end_seconds": 635.7,
    "text": "would want to live to 150."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:35.700",
    "end": "00:10:37.540",
    "start_seconds": 635.7,
    "end_seconds": 637.54,
    "text": "I think this is not far off,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:37.540",
    "end": "00:10:42.820",
    "start_seconds": 637.54,
    "end_seconds": 642.82,
    "text": "given the advancement of genetics and DNA sampling."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:42.820",
    "end": "00:10:45.420",
    "start_seconds": 642.82,
    "end_seconds": 645.42,
    "text": "And like I said, neuroscience."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:45.420",
    "end": "00:10:50.220",
    "start_seconds": 645.42,
    "end_seconds": 650.22,
    "text": "I think humans, being a multi-planetary species,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:50.260",
    "end": "00:10:52.020",
    "start_seconds": 650.26,
    "end_seconds": 652.02,
    "text": "are not far from that as well."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:52.020",
    "end": "00:10:54.980",
    "start_seconds": 652.02,
    "end_seconds": 654.98,
    "text": "The access to different planets has become easier and easier"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:55.020",
    "end": "00:10:56.540",
    "start_seconds": 655.02,
    "end_seconds": 656.54,
    "text": "and cost-effective."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:56.540",
    "end": "00:10:59.540",
    "start_seconds": 656.54,
    "end_seconds": 659.54,
    "text": "So this is also a bold kind of thought"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:59.580",
    "end": "00:11:03.420",
    "start_seconds": 659.58,
    "end_seconds": 663.42,
    "text": "that’s probably exciting scientists."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:03.420",
    "end": "00:11:06.020",
    "start_seconds": 663.42,
    "end_seconds": 666.02,
    "text": "... I think we have enough on Earth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:06.020",
    "end": "00:11:08.820",
    "start_seconds": 666.02,
    "end_seconds": 668.82,
    "text": "I don't know if we want to be there, but of course, I mean,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:08.860",
    "end": "00:11:13.020",
    "start_seconds": 668.86,
    "end_seconds": 673.02,
    "text": "having that is something that everyone is excited about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:13.060",
    "end": "00:11:15.020",
    "start_seconds": 673.06,
    "end_seconds": 675.02,
    "text": "It’s a bold statement but achievable."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:15.500",
    "end": "00:11:19.060",
    "start_seconds": 675.5,
    "end_seconds": 679.06,
    "text": "But the one that really, really, really makes me think a lot,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:19.060",
    "end": "00:11:21.100",
    "start_seconds": 679.06,
    "end_seconds": 681.1,
    "text": "[and] is slightly relevant to the comment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:21.100",
    "end": "00:11:22.500",
    "start_seconds": 681.1,
    "end_seconds": 682.5,
    "text": "I mentioned, is:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:22.500",
    "end": "00:11:28.700",
    "start_seconds": 682.5,
    "end_seconds": 688.7,
    "text": "once you really infuse human intelligence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:28.700",
    "end": "00:11:31.180",
    "start_seconds": 688.7,
    "end_seconds": 691.18,
    "text": "with artificial intelligence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:31.220",
    "end": "00:11:33.220",
    "start_seconds": 691.22,
    "end_seconds": 693.22,
    "text": "into one neural network,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:34.580",
    "end": "00:11:36.020",
    "start_seconds": 694.58,
    "end_seconds": 696.02,
    "text": "when this happens,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:36.060",
    "end": "00:11:39.300",
    "start_seconds": 696.06,
    "end_seconds": 699.3,
    "text": "this is when things are going to be really exciting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:39.300",
    "end": "00:11:43.460",
    "start_seconds": 699.3,
    "end_seconds": 703.46,
    "text": "because we're talking about AI being super smart,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:43.500",
    "end": "00:11:45.460",
    "start_seconds": 703.5,
    "end_seconds": 705.46,
    "text": "almost human-like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:46.100",
    "end": "00:11:48.340",
    "start_seconds": 706.1,
    "end_seconds": 708.34,
    "text": "And this, to the previous point,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:48.340",
    "end": "00:11:50.740",
    "start_seconds": 708.34,
    "end_seconds": 710.74,
    "text": "is happening and happening very soon."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:50.780",
    "end": "00:11:52.660",
    "start_seconds": 710.78,
    "end_seconds": 712.66,
    "text": "Look at how we're dealing with ChatGPT."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:52.700",
    "end": "00:11:56.060",
    "start_seconds": 712.7,
    "end_seconds": 716.06,
    "text": "But then what if AI was infused in a human,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:56.060",
    "end": "00:12:00.780",
    "start_seconds": 716.06,
    "end_seconds": 720.78,
    "text": "having a single kind of network"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:00.780",
    "end": "00:12:04.260",
    "start_seconds": 720.78,
    "end_seconds": 724.26,
    "text": "... that connects human intelligence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:04.260",
    "end": "00:12:05.940",
    "start_seconds": 724.26,
    "end_seconds": 725.94,
    "text": "with artificial intelligence?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:05.940",
    "end": "00:12:08.380",
    "start_seconds": 725.94,
    "end_seconds": 728.38,
    "text": "I think, with neuroscience, this is not very far."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:08.380",
    "end": "00:12:13.820",
    "start_seconds": 728.38,
    "end_seconds": 733.82,
    "text": "And this is something that really requires, again, collaboration,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:13.860",
    "end": "00:12:17.740",
    "start_seconds": 733.86,
    "end_seconds": 737.74,
    "text": "understanding and unity, because this is a whole new world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:18.140",
    "end": "00:12:21.260",
    "start_seconds": 738.14,
    "end_seconds": 741.26,
    "text": "WPR: Well, Your Excellency, this has been insightful and exciting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:21.260",
    "end": "00:12:22.980",
    "start_seconds": 741.26,
    "end_seconds": 742.98,
    "text": "I'm sure I speak for everyone here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:22.980",
    "end": "00:12:25.700",
    "start_seconds": 742.98,
    "end_seconds": 745.7,
    "text": "Thank you so much for taking the time to be with us today."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:25.740",
    "end": "00:12:28.020",
    "start_seconds": 745.74,
    "end_seconds": 748.02,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
